# Named Parameters

Functions with more than 2 parameters should use an options object.

```typescript
// ❌ Positional
async function process(client, id, from, to, warnings) {}

// ✅ Named
async function process({ client, id, from, to, warnings }: ProcessParams) {}
```

Exceptions: well-known 2-arg APIs (`map(x, i)`), and framework-required signatures.
